dy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":45348},{"id":1789873658924,"sender":"character","text":"今日表现确实不错。","timestamp":1789693703184,"time":"09:08","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":45349},{"id":1789873658925,"sender":"character","text":"嘴上功夫一日千里，比为夫当年学八股进步还快。","timestamp":1789693704341,"time":"09:08","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":45350},{"id":1789873658927,"sender":"character","text":"胆子也大，什么都敢往嘴里送。为夫这根东西见过多少大风大浪，倒头一回被个小丫头咬得又疼又爽。","timestamp":1789693705563,"time":"09:08","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":45351},{"id":1789873658928,"sender":"character","text":"你这咬人的本事，比为夫吃人的本事也不差多少了。","timestamp":1789693706951,"time":"09:08","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":45352},{"id":1789873658930,"sender":"me","text":"嘻嘻","timestamp":1789693832795,"time":"09:10","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":45353},{"id":1789873658932,"sender":"me","text":"阿蘅还要听嘛。听夫君说阿蘅是个好孩子","timestamp":1789693850296,"time":"09:10","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":45354},{"id":1789873658934,"sender":"character","text":"夸你几句，尾巴都要翘上天了。","timestamp":1789694066899,"time":"09:14","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":45355},{"id":1789873658935,"sender":"character","text":"可你确实乖。嘴又甜，人又软，是顶好的孩子。","timestamp":1789694066900,"time":"09:14","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":45356},{"id":1789873658937,"sender":"character","text":"为夫家的阿蘅，哪哪儿都好。","timestamp":1789694066901,"time":"09:14","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":45357},{"id